    {
      "_id": "kRuleNtsWSy8pUnH",
      "type": "text",
      "name": "",
      "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg",
      "description": "<p>Your debut composition reduced the audience to a gibbering mess, murmuring of bright creatures descending from the night sky. Later you noticed that the notes resembled stellar constellations. Take a <strong>Book On Astronomy</strong>, and a lot of questions.</p>",
      "weight": 1,
