      "type": "text",
      "name": "",
      "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg",
      "description": "<p>You mocked a forgotten trickster god and were cursed for it. You speak only in perfect rhyme. Ironically, this has only made you more popular among your peers. Take a <strong>Thesaurus</strong> (20gp). Without it, you are <em>deprived</em>.</p>",
